🟢 验证评审 (reviewer-only, automatic): Plan Reviewer/Reviewer check the verification plan against the manual. STAGE 3 代码设计 IP05: 数字设计 (RTL Code Engineer of the chosen lane): implement per the confirmed manual under the style contract; write the 详细设计 per templates/detail-design.md one-to-one with the code (no code inside the doc); 数字验证 parallel: 环境开发 → 用例开发 → 验证调试 (验证报告 + 验证手册 per templates/validation-report.md / validation-manual.md). Consistency rule: no non-essential difference between detail manual/code and the internal user manual — on real divergence, stash the stage-3 files (git stash / copy aside), re-run stage 2 to correct the manual, get it confirmed, return and redo stage 3; never patch around the divergence. 🟢 设计评审 + 🟢 验证评审 (reviewer-only, no user halt): Reviewer/Plan Reviewer check code + detail manual + validation debug results; the verification engineer reports the manual-vs-code consistency check first. STAGE 4 设计验证 IP08 → IP 发布 IP10: 缺陷解决 (design) ↔ 验证调试/回归 (verification): fix defects, rerun affected cases then full 回归验证 dual-track — track 1 functional per the internal manual (cocotb or UVM lane per backend, all cases PASS), track 2 coverage per the detail design (verilator merge/report or VCS urg + fsdbreport, targets met or justified). 设计发布: 内部 + 外部用户手册 (external = pure subset) per templates/user-manual.md → 🔴 GATE 发布评审 (Reviewer findings first, then user halt). 缺陷分析: 缺陷报告 + Buglist per templates/defect-report.md → 🔴 GATE 缺陷评审 (Reviewer findings first, then user halt; closure before IP10). IP10 = all reviews green + dual-track evidence committed."
